{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Mercury Retrograde"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "The Lost File"}, {"type": "position", "content": 3}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 17}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Exchange information about hypothetical situations in written and spoken interactions according to work and social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " The Narrative Tenses: Simple Past and Past Continuous"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " Narrative tenses are verb tenses that are used to talk about the past. They are often found in stories and descriptions of past events, such as personal anecdotes."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The <span class=\"strong\">Simple Past</span> has several uses in a narrative."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ol> <li>To talk about habits in the past: What did the character routinely do? Use adverbs of frequency to add detail here. </li>For example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">Henry <span class=\"strong\">always made</span> others laugh.</span><br/> <br/> <li>To talk about duration in the past: How long did something happen? Use the prepositions for.</li>For example:<br/> <span class=\"italic\">Henry <span class=\"strong\">lived</span> there <span class=\"strong\">for 5 years</span>.</span><br/> <br/> <li>Completed actions: What was the sequence of events and how did they come to an end?</li> For example:<br/> <span class=\"italic\">Henry, badly frightened, <span class=\"strong\">threw </span>open the trap door in the floor and <span class=\"strong\">climbed </span>down the ladder into the small, dark hole.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "The <span class=\"strong\">Past Continuous</span> is useful in a narrative. Here are some uses:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ol> <li>To talk about an interrupted action: you use the Past Continuous as background to a more important or dramatic event, which is in the past. </li>For example: <br/> <span class=\"italic\">Henry <span class=\"strong\">was preparing</span> dinner when he sliced his finger.</span><br/> <br/> <li>To talk about a simultaneous action. You use the continuous tense to demonstrate that the two actions are happening at the same time, not one after the other.</li>For example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">I <span class=\"strong\">was saving</span> the document to my hard drive regularly and <span class=\"strong\">backing up</span> my files to an external hard drive too. But somehow I deleted this document. </span> "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I was working on a file that was saved on my desktop."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Suddenly, it disappeared! "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Somehow I deleted this document."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I unplugged the modem and plugged it back in."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Relative Clause or Noun Clause?"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "After nouns, you use <span class=\"italic\"> that </span> to introduce both relative and noun clauses. <br/> Let's look at  important differences between the two."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">She made a promise <span class=\"strong\">that she would return all the money</span>.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "In this example, the <span class=\"underline\">noun clause</span> (<span class=\"strong\">that she would return all the money</span>) adds meaning to the word <span class=\"italic\">promise </span>and tells us what it is. You cannot replace <span class=\"italic\">that </span>with <span class=\"italic\">which</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">She made a promise <span class=\"strong\">that she failed to keep</span>.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "In this example, we don't know what the promise was (there is no added meaning). You can replace <span class=\"italic\">that </span>with <span class=\"italic\">which </span>in <span class=\"underline\">relative clauses</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Look at some more examples from the text. Can you identify whether they use noun clauses or relative clauses? "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I found all the other files that I had saved."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I tend to follow the superstitions that are just common sense, like \u201cdon't walk under a ladder.\u201d"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I swear that there's something really strange going on."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Are you sure it's not just a coincidence that they are both having problems at the same time?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I really believe that there's more to it than just a coincidence."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Do you believe that some of our actions can bring us bad luck?"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "desktop"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the \u200bscreen \u200barea of a \u200bpersonal \u200bcomputer when no \u200bprograms are being used"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I was working on a file that was saved on my desktop."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob03aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about strange events and technology."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "at my wit's end"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "perplexed; at the end of one's ideas "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm at my wit's end! "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob03aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "coincidence"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "when two or more things unexpectedly happen at the same time"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Are you sure it's not just a coincidence that they are both having problems at the same time?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob03aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to spill"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to cause or allow something to flow over the edge of its container, especially unintentionally"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Although, I do throw salt over my shoulder if I spill it on the table and I don't open my umbrella inside."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob03aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "common sense"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the \u200bability to use good \u200bjudgment in making \u200bdecisions and to \u200blive in a \u200breasonable and \u200bsafe way"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I tend to follow the superstitions that are just common sense, like \u201cdon't walk under a ladder\u201d. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob03aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "external"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "\u200bexisting, \u200bintended for, or \u200bhappening \u200boutside "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I was saving the document to my hard drive regularly and backing up my files to an external hard drive too."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob03aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "hard drive"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a \u200bdisk on which a large \u200bamount of \u200binformation can be \u200bstored and used by a \u200bcomputer or other \u200bpiece of \u200belectronic \u200bequipment"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I think that my hard drive may be corrupt."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob03aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to delete"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to remove all or part of an electronic or written text"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Somehow I deleted this document."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le17ob03aud08"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn10le17ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "On the internet, research superstitions in your country or another country."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Choose one superstition that is interesting to you and do more research."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a paragraph about the superstition that you chose. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your paragraph to your group."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Listen to the other students read their paragraphs."}, {"type": "text", "content": "In your group, decide which superstition is the most believable and which is the least believable."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I research a superstition on the internet."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a paragraph about a superstition."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read my paragraph to a group."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I listen to other paragraphs."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I choose the most and least believable superstition."}]}], "labs": [{"type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"type": "audio", "title": "", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn10le17ob03re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn10le17ob03re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Vanessa, I'm at my wit's end!\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Peter, what's wrong?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I've lost a really important file. I was working on a file that was saved on my desktop. Suddenly, it disappeared! I swear that there's something really strange going on. First my phone, now my computer. There's a bigger power at work here.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Are you sure it's not just a coincidence that they are both having problems at the same time?", "id": 1}, {"time": "27000", "image": "engenn10le17ob03re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  I really believe that there's more to it than just a coincidence. Do you believe in superstitions? Do you believe that some of our actions can bring us bad luck?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: No, not really. Although I do throw salt over my shoulder if I spill it on the table, and I don't open my umbrella inside. But I'm not scared of black cats! I tend to follow the superstitions that are just common sense, like \u201cdon't walk under a ladder.\u201d Anyway, let's figure out your computer.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Okay. Do you have any ideas of what might have happened? I was saving the document to my hard drive regularly and backing up my files to an external hard drive too. But somehow I deleted this document.", "id": 2}, {"time": "70000", "image": "engenn10le17ob03re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Did you save it to a memory stick?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: No, I didn't.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Did you do a search on your computer for the missing file?\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yes, I did that. I found all the other files that I had saved. I unplugged the modem and plugged it back in.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It is really strange that the file disappeared. Maybe we should take your phone and your laptop into the repair shop. I'll come with you.", "id": 3}], "audiosrc": "engenn10le17ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le17ob03re2img01.jpg"}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "template_override": 1, "questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "_data": [{"type": "ins